# Inventive Wingsmith {2}{W} 2/4: "At the beginning of your end step, if you haven't cast a spell from your hand this turn and
# this creature doesn't have a flying counter on it, put a flying counter on it." Bot1 casts it from their hand on turn one, so
# no counter at that end step. On turn three Bot1 casts nothing: the counter is put on it and it has flying. On turn five it
# already has one, so the ability does not trigger again and it still has exactly one.

